# Per-file worker pool default & unit lowering root-cause regression spec.
#
# Covers:
# 1. SCV snapshot + `--source <root>/src/<pkg>` + nested `src/` resolution-root
#    canonicalization so importing units match summary surfaces 1:1 across SCV
#    snapshot, custom SIMPLE_SCV_SNAPSHOT_ROOT, `<checkout>/src/app/...`,
#    nested `src/app/vscode_extension/src/...`, and `<checkout>/app/...`.
# 2. Multiline `pub use` / `export use` TLDR summary extraction (including `#`
#    comments with unbalanced `{` / `}` braces) without fallback.
# 3. Direct target-placeholder detection on package-sibling re-exports:
#    - skips sibling re-exports targeting empty worker placeholders for both
#      zero-import leaves and `>= 1`-import sibling modules;
#    - resolves sibling re-exports targeting built modules even on zero-import leaves;
#    - preserves `[E-HIR-UNDECL-IMPORT-001]` diagnostics when a sibling facade
#      re-exports a missing symbol from a built module.
# 4. Pre-sealed `SIMPLE_MIR_SHARD_LINK` skips redundant two-pass shard pools, and
#    `config/bootstrap.sdn` + `bootstrap_select_stage3_file_workers` default to
#    per-file (`1`) while honoring explicit `SIMPLE_FILE_WORKERS=0` opt-out.
# 5. Multi-file importing closure (4 modules: leaf_a, leaf_zero, facade, main)
#    plans and resolves surfaces cleanly under unit TLDR imports (with & without
#    SCV snapshot paths).

use std.spec.*
use std.io_runtime.{file_read, file_write, dir_create_all, getpid, process_run}
use std.nogc_sync_mut.io.env_ops.{env_get, env_set}
